 "title": "SMBJ series: 600 W surface-mount transient voltage suppressors, SMB (DO-214AA)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:1.1",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "Transient voltage suppressor diodes with a glass-passivated junction, packaged in SMB (DO-214AA), each able to take a 600 W peak in a 10/1000 µs pulse. The range covers stand-off voltages from 3.3 V to 440 V; the A suffix holds breakdown voltage within 5 %, and each voltage is sold one-way (A) or two-way (CA). Intended uses are protecting I/O ports, supply rails and other exposed nodes in telecom, computer, industrial and consumer products.",
